msgctxt "136"
msgid "(Boxcelios... An arcade shooter...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid ""
"Boxcelios puts you in the seat of an invincible fighter and challenges you "
"to destroy as many enemies as possible before time runs out. Move your ship "
"with the "
"<Action:Button_LS_Up@Shooting><Action:Button_LS_Down@Shooting><Action:Button_LS_Left@Shooting><Action:Button_LS_Right@Shooting>,"
" and fire your laser cannons with <Action:Button_Cross@Shooting>."
msgstr ""
"Boxcelios ti mette ai comandi di un caccia invincibile e ti sfida a "
"distruggere quanti più nemici possibile prima che scada il tempo. Muovi la "
"tua nave con "
"<Action:Button_LS_Up@Shooting><Action:Button_LS_Down@Shooting><Action:Button_LS_Left@Shooting><Action:Button_LS_Right@Shooting>,"
" e spara con i tuoi cannoni laser usando <Action:Button_Cross@Shooting>."

msgctxt "160"
msgid ""
"Shoot and destroy either the glowing core or the majority of enemy ships to "
"take them down."
msgstr ""
"Spara e distruggi il nucleo luminoso o la maggior parte delle navi nemiche "
"per abbatterle."

msgctxt "172"
msgid ""
"Time stands still for two seconds after an enemy appears. Use this time to "
"aim for the enemy's core for maximum efficiency."
msgstr ""
"Il tempo si blocca per due secondi dopo che appare un nemico. Sfrutta questo"
" tempo per mirare al nucleo del nemico e ottenere la massima efficienza."

msgctxt "184"
msgid "(Boxcelios... 100 yen for one game. Hmm...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "(Okay, I think I'll give it a try.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "(I don't have enough money...)"
msgstr "(Non ho abbastanza soldi...)"

msgctxt "244"
msgid "(Maybe later...)"
msgstr "(Magari dopo...)"

msgctxt "256"
msgid "Play"
msgstr "Gioca"

msgctxt "268"
msgid "Read the Instructions"
msgstr "Leggi le Istruzioni"

msgctxt "280"
msgid "Never Mind"
msgstr "Lascia perdere"

